 "remarks": "Downtown Darien's Corbin District! Experience downtown living in this stunning 2,040 sq ft top floor corner unit. This beautifully designed corner residence offers and incredibly spacious open concept kitchen/living area. The chef's kitchen offers quartz countertops with a combined living area with oversized windows. This residence offers lots of natural light, a home office as well as a powder room all with 9+ft ceilings. There are 2 generous sized bedrooms each with their own bathrooms. This residence has tons of storage as well! Building amenities include access to a shared rooftop terrace/courtyard, elevator service from a secure lower-level garage and professional management. This residence perfectly blends modern luxury with an unbeatable location with walk to shop/restaurants and fitness options all located in downtown Darien.",
